sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Editor SPA (Save)
  participant S as SaveRoomLayout
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant RV as Reverb
  participant V as Other editor SPA
  A->>S: PUT layout (expected_revision, workstations, fixtures)
  S->>DB: lock the layout row, compare revision
  alt revision is stale
    S-->>A: 409 layout_stale + current plan (editor merges per object)
  else revision is current
    S->>DB: write positions + fixtures, revision + 1, audit (one transaction)
    S->>RV: after commit: RoomPlanChanged (layout_version, revision, cause, by.name)
    RV-->>V: event (or polling fallback while the draft is clean)
    V->>V: clean draft refetches, dirty draft offers Combine now
  end
